This repository builds a container image from third-party components, each under its own license:

- CycloneDX cdxgen (https://github.com/CycloneDX/cdxgen) - Apache License 2.0; installed as the npm package
  @cyclonedx/cdxgen with its dependency tree (versions and hashes in package-lock.json, licenses in the
  image SBOM published with every release).
- Google Distroless base image gcr.io/distroless/nodejs24-debian13 (https://github.com/GoogleContainerTools/distroless)
  - Apache License 2.0; it contains Node.js (MIT) and Debian packages under their respective licenses.
- Node.js official image docker.io/library/node (build stage only) - MIT License for the image recipe,
  Node.js license for the runtime.
- Python official image docker.io/library/python (build stage only; interpreter files copied into the image)
  - Python Software Foundation License 2.0.
- uv (https://github.com/astral-sh/uv) - Apache License 2.0 or MIT License, at your option.
- zlib (https://zlib.net) - zlib License; the zlib1g package of Debian sid replaces the one of the base image
  until the fix for CVE-2026-76844 and CVE-2026-85091 reaches Debian trixie.

The image is not an official build of any of the projects above.
